# NOTE: docs/ is intentionally TRACKED. The playbooks under docs/playbooks/ are
# real project deliverables and must be committed. Tracked/committed files do not
# trip the pre-push generated-files staleness gate (that only flags UNTRACKED
# output of generate_repo.py); the doc paths are also outside the CI workflow's
# path filter, so committing them triggers no CI run.
